{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for the\u00a0<strong>Empyrean Realm</strong>\u00a0has begun. A ruthless enemy commander has launched a full scale invasion, searching for the <strong>Empyreal Core</strong>, an ancient secret technology hidden deep within the realm. As the last line of defense, you must deploy, upgrade, and adapt a wide array of military, economic, and support sites to survive increasingly intense enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empyrean Defense</strong> is fast paced, challenging, and deeply strategic. Success depends on quick decision making, smart positioning, and long term planning as enemy pressure escalates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.poster.avif?t=1774161017\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.webm?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.mp4?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Defense with Modern Military Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a variety of defensive and support structures, from <strong>sniper towers and missile launchers</strong> to <strong>research centers and power plants</strong>. Each site plays a vital role in your defense:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Military</strong>:\u00a0Engage enemies directly with a mix of classic and advanced structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic</strong>: Generate valuable resources to fund expansion and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power</strong>: Maintain an energy grid to support advanced infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong>: Research new technologies that enhance and specialize your defenses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Defend, Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Sites</strong>: Upgrade and modify key components to adapt to any battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Waves</strong>: Face ground, naval, and airborne units, including powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Call in<strong> airstrikes</strong>, deploy protective<strong> bubble shields</strong>, and even manipulate the battlefield with <strong>lightning storms</strong> and <strong>blizzards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 40+ skills across 4 branches in the skill tree, 20+ enemy units and bosses, 25+ sites to build and upgrade, and 15+ active abilities to learn, every decision matters and no two defenses play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/df1a416703fa26b48e031af3c91c5150.poster.avif?t=1774161017\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/df1a416703fa26b48e031af3c91c5150.webm?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/df1a416703fa26b48e031af3c91c5150.mp4?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/e2f0406cbb19022b7fadece4332eef5d.poster.avif?t=1774161017\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/e2f0406cbb19022b7fadece4332eef5d.webm?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/e2f0406cbb19022b7fadece4332eef5d.mp4?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>War Across 27 Regions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend<strong> forests</strong>,<strong> deserts</strong>,<strong> snowy mountains</strong>,<strong> </strong>and<strong> warn torn cities</strong>\u00a0across 27 regions. Each region introduces new threats, terrain challenges, and enemy tactics that demand constant adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story-Driven Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a progressing campaign featuring four core characters who provide tactical guidance and battlefield banter as the conflict unfolds. This war is about more than survival. It is about stopping the enemy commander before he unlocks the power of the <strong>Empyreal Core</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep up, adapt under pressure, and prevent the realm\u2019s secrets from falling into enemy hands?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575690?t=1774161017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575690?t=1774161017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/8d0251f6e2c77f12a67483800bb6e8a34107bb81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774161017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/8d0251f6e2c77f12a67483800bb6e8a34107bb81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774161017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for the\u00a0<strong>Empyrean Realm</strong>\u00a0has begun. A ruthless enemy commander has launched a full scale invasion, searching for the <strong>Empyreal Core</strong>, an ancient secret technology hidden deep within the realm. As the last line of defense, you must deploy, upgrade, and adapt a wide array of military, economic, and support sites to survive increasingly intense enemy assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empyrean Defense</strong> is fast paced, challenging, and deeply strategic. Success depends on quick decision making, smart positioning, and long term planning as enemy pressure escalates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.poster.avif?t=1774161017\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.webm?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/949387c890523a5f634b1c0b91638a76.mp4?t=1774161017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Defense with Modern Military Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a variety of defensive and support structures, from <strong>sniper towers and missile launchers</strong> to <strong>research centers and power plants</strong>. Each site plays a vital role in your defense:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Military</strong>:\u00a0Engage enemies directly with a mix of classic and advanced structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economic</strong>: Generate valuable resources to fund expansion and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power</strong>: Maintain an energy grid to support advanced infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong>: Research new technologies that enhance and specialize your defenses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Defend, Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Sites</strong>: Upgrade and modify key components to adapt to any battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Waves</strong>: Face ground, naval, and airborne units, including powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Call in<strong> airstrikes</strong>, deploy protective<strong> bubble shields</strong>, and even manipulate the battlefield with <strong>lightning storms</strong> and <strong>blizzards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 40+ skills across 4 branches in the skill tree, 20+ enemy units and bosses, 25+ sites to build and upgrade, and 15+ active abilities to learn, every decision matters and no two defenses play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/extras/df1a416703fa26b48e031af3c91c5150.poster.avif?t=1774161017\" width=380 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com